---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="King Post Studio is a HubSpot CMS shop in Robbinsville, North Carolina."
>
  <section class="stack">
    <div class="page-head">
      <h1>About</h1>
      <div class="rule-double" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    </div>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>I run King Post Studio from Robbinsville, North Carolina.</p>
      <p>
        HubSpot CMS themes and apps for teams that need a durable platform, not a throwaway page.
      </p>
      <p>I left software in pharma to build this shop.</p>
      <p>
        I wrote the HubSpot developer post on{' '}
        <a
          href="https://developers.hubspot.com/blog/building-snappy-and-responsive-hubspot-themes-with-lit-and-vite"
          rel="noreferrer"
        >
          Lit, Vite, and Storybook themes
        </a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
